    "description": "The spine: a project owned by an organisation, the resolutions it captures at, and the screens it tracks. States, shots and comparisons arrive with the milestones that first need them.",
    "items": [
      {
        "table": "project",
        "description": "One legacy app and the rebuilds chasing it. Belongs to an organisation, never to a user, because tenancy retrofitted onto rows written without it is the migration nobody wants.",
